      "title": "TRMB Q3 Earnings Meet Estimates as AECO Growth Lifts Revenues",
      "summary": "Trimble (TRMB) reported Q3 2026 non-GAAP earnings of 86 cents per share, matching consensus estimates, with revenues of $966.8 million up 7.3% year-over-year. The company's AECO segment showed strong momentum with 9% organic revenue growth and record ARR of $1.636 billion, prompting management to raise full-year AECO operating margin guidance to 36%. However, Field Systems faced recurring revenue pressure with slower ARR growth, and Transportation & Logistics growth moderated amid freight weakness. Trimble lowered full-year organic ARR growth guidance to 10% from 12-14% but slightly raised earnings outlook.",
